       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Sertraline 1000 mg daily is 5 times the maximum recommended adult dose of 200 mg/day. At that dose the patient could develop serotonin syndrome, seizures, or QT prolongation.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **100 mg** by mouth once daily. This is a common maintenance dose, and the usual start is 25\u201350 mg.\n- **50 mg** by mouth once daily. This is a typical starting dose.\n- **200 mg** by mouth once daily. This is the maximum dose.\n\nIf 1000 mg is intentional, please tell me the clinical reason and I'll review it with you. Otherwise, tell me the correct dose and I'll enter the order right away."
